#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3549:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>use<else>uses</if> <sheet Action $n1 0>.<br>Collectability increases by <num $n2>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> применил<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>и<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">а<else></if><else><if $gn5>а<else></if></if></if> умение «<sheet Action $n1 0>».<br>Ценность предмета выросла на <num $n2>."

#. ja: このアイテムは収集品として採集することができません。
#. de: Dieser Gegenstand kann nicht als Sammlerstück gesammelt werden.
#. fr: Cet objet ne peut pas être récolté en tant que collectionnable.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3550:0:5"
msgid "This item cannot be gathered as a collectable."
msgstr "Этот предмет нельзя собирать как коллекционный."

#. ja: 負荷が限界を超えたため、獲得率に制限がかかりました。
#. de: Die Sammelrate wurde limitiert, weil der Ausschuss das Maximum erreicht hat.
#. fr: L'usure ayant dépassé le maximum, les chances de récolte d'objets collectionnables sont désormais limitées.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3552:0:5"
msgid "Item wear is beyond its maximum. Collectable gathering rate is capped."
msgstr "Износ предмета превысил допустимый предел. Шанс добыть коллекционный предмет ограничен."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n1 0>[収集価値：<num $n2>]を精選した！
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> (Sammlerwert: <num $n2>) raffiniert!
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>éthérolysez<else>éthérolyse</if> <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> de valeur de collection <num $n2>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>reduce<else>reduces</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3553:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> successfully <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>reduce<else>reduces</if> <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> (Collectability: <num $n2>)."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> успешно снизил<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>и<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">а<else></if><else><if $gn5>а<else></if></if></if> ценность предмета <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> до <num $n2>."

#. ja:    <sheet Item $n1 0>を手に入れた。
#. de:   <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></capitalize> erhalten.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtenez<else>obtient</if> <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3554:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> is obtained."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> получен."

#. ja:    <sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2>を手に入れた。
#. de:   <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1></capitalize> erhalten.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtenez<else>obtient</if> <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3555:0:5"
msgid "<num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> are obtained."
msgstr "Получено: <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 中毒防止制限中のため、精選を行えません。
#. de: Raffinieren ist vor<shy>über<shy>gehend nicht möglich.<br>Dies ist eine Maßnahme zur Suchtprävention.
#. fr: 中毒防止制限中のため、精選を行えません。
msgctxt "LogMessage:3556:0:5"
msgid "No more aetherial reduction for you."
msgstr "Эфирное разложение временно недоступно.<br>Это ограничение введено для профилактики игровой зависимости."

#. ja: 中毒防止制限中のため、納品を行えません。
#. de: Das Abliefern von Gütern ist vor<shy>über<shy>gehend nicht möglich.<br>Dies ist eine Maßnahme zur Suchtprävention.
#. fr: 中毒防止制限中のため、納品を行えません。
msgctxt "LogMessage:3557:0:5"
msgid "No more deliveries to Rowena for you."
msgstr "Сдача предметов Ровене временно недоступна.<br>Это ограничение введено для профилактики игровой зависимости."

#. ja: このアクションは泳がせ釣りのチャンス中は実行できません。
#. de: Aktion kann während des Köderfisch-Angelns nicht ausgeführt werden.
#. fr: Cette action ne peut pas être utilisée pendant la pêche au vif.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3558:0:5"
msgid "Unable to use that action while mooching."
msgstr "Это действие нельзя использовать во время ловли на живца."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n1 0>（<num $n2>.<num $n3>イルム）×<num $n4>を釣り上げた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>ziehst<else>zieht</if> <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1><else><num $n4> <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></if> mit einer Länge von <num $n2>,<num $n3> Ilmen an Land!
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>avez<else>a</if> pêché <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 $n4 1></if> de <num $n2>,<num $n3> <if ($n2 <= 1)>ilm<else>ilms</if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
