msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>land<else>lands</if> <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1></if> measuring <num $n2>.<num $n3> ilms!"
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> поймал<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>и<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">а<else></if><else><if $gn5>а<else></if></if></if> <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1></if> длиной <num $n2>.<num $n3> ильма!"

#. ja: 魚影を感知しなかった。
#. de: Es sind keine Fische zu sehen.
#. fr: Vous ne détectez pas de courant poissonneux.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3560:0:5"
msgid "You detect no shadows in the water."
msgstr "Вы не замечаете теней в воде."

#. ja: <string $s3>にレベル<num $n2>の<sheet GatheringPointName $n1 0>を感知した！
#. de: Du hast <noun-de GatheringPointName 1 $n1 1 4 1> der Güte <num $n2> im <string $s3> entdeckt!
#. fr: Vous détectez <noun-fr GatheringPointName 1 $n1 1 1> de niveau <num $n2> du côté <lower><string $s3></lower>.
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en GatheringPointName 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = GatheringPointName, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s3> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3561:0:5"
msgid "You sense a level <num $n2> <noun-en GatheringPointName 3 $n1 1 1> to the <string $s3>."
msgstr "Вы ощущаете: <noun-en GatheringPointName 3 $n1 1 1> ур. <num $n2> к <string $s3>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>の警戒心が高まり、気配が消えた……
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> haben dich entdeckt und sind geflüchtet.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 2 1></capitalize> ont détecté votre présence et ont fui...
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3562:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> are aware of your presence and have left the area."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> почуяли ваше присутствие и покинули это место."

#. ja:    ダブルボーナスが発生した！
#. de:    Doppelbonus!
#. fr:    Vous bénéficiez d'un double bonus<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:3563:0:5"
msgid "   You receive a double bonus!"
msgstr "   Вы получаете двойной бонус!"

#. ja: 自動精選が中断されました。
#. de: Das automatische Raffinieren wurde abgebrochen.
#. fr: L'éthérolyse rapide a été interrompue.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3564:0:5"
msgid "Automatic aetherial reduction canceled."
msgstr "Автоматическое эфирное разложение отменено."

#. ja: 漁場を感知しなかった。
#. de: Du entdeckst keinen Speerfischgrund.
#. fr: Vous ne détectez pas de point de harponnage.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3568:0:5"
msgid "You detect no teeming waters."
msgstr "Вы не обнаружили богатых рыбой вод."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>の「<sheet Action $n1 0>」<br>   バリューアップ発生！ 収集価値が <num $n2>上昇した。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> setzt „<sheet Action $n1 0>“ ein.<br> Du vertraust deiner Intuition. Sammlerwert um <num $n2> gestiegen.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>utilisez<else>utilise</if> <sheet Action $n1 0>.<br> Votre Intuition vous guide<nbsp>! La valeur de collection augmente de <num $n2><nbsp>!
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
