#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>use<else>uses</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet Action $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Action, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3569:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>use<else>uses</if> <sheet Action $n1 0>.<br>Collector's intuition guides your hand. Collectability increases by <num $n2>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> применил<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>и<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">а<else></if><else><if $gn5>а<else></if></if></if> умение «<sheet Action $n1 0>».<br>Интуиция собирателя не подвела! Ценность предмета выросла на <num $n2>."

#. ja: 現在この場所では、これ以上漁が行えません。
#. de: Du kannst an diesem Ort zurzeit nichts weiter fangen.
#. fr: Impossible de faire davantage de prises à cet endroit.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3570:0:5"
msgid "Unable to spearfish any further at this point."
msgstr "В этом месте больше нельзя ловить острогой."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>で漁を開始した。
#. de: Du beginnst mit dem Speerfischen.
#. fr: Vous commencez à pêcher au harpon. <br>Point de pêche<nbsp>: <sheet PlaceName $n1 0>.
#. macro: <if "<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>"><switch "<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>"><case>in <case>on </switch><else>at </if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet PlaceName $n1 1> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = PlaceName, row = number parameter 1, column = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch "<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>"><case>in <case>on </switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = PlaceName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3571:0:5"
msgid "You begin spearfishing <if \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><switch \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><case>in <case>on </switch><else>at </if><noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Вы начинаете ловить острогой <if \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><switch \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><case>в <case>на </switch><else>у </if><noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は漁を終えた。
#. de: Du steckst die Harpune weg.
#. fr: Vous arrêtez de pêcher au harpon.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3572:0:5"
msgid "You put away your gig."
msgstr "Вы убираете острогу."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は漁用の副道具を持っていないため、漁が行えません。
#. de: Du kannst nicht speerfischen,<br>da du nicht das richtige Werkzeug in der Nebenhand angelegt hast.
#. fr: Impossible de pêcher au harpon. Vous n'avez pas l'outil secondaire adéquat.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3574:0:5"
msgid "Unable to spearfish. Appropriate off hand tool not equipped."
msgstr "Нельзя ловить острогой: не экипирован подходящий инструмент для левой руки."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は漁師ではないため、漁が行えません。
#. de: Speerfischen nicht möglich. Die Klasse muss Fischer sein.
#. fr: Impossible de pêcher au harpon. Vous n'êtes pas dans la bonne classe.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3575:0:5"
msgid "Unable to spearfish. Class not set to fisher."
msgstr "Нельзя ловить острогой: выбран не класс рыбака."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は<sheet Item $n1 0>（<num $n2>.<num $n3>イルム）を入手した。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> (<num $n2>,<num $n3> Ilme) aufgespießt.
#. fr: Vous avez pêché <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> de <num $n2>,<num $n3> <if ($n2 <= 1)>ilm<else>ilms</if>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3576:0:5"
msgid "You spear <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> measuring <num $n2>.<num $n3> ilms!"
msgstr "Вы ловите острогой <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> длиной <num $n2>.<num $n3> ильма!"

#. ja: <string $gs1>は<sheet Item $n1 0>（<num $n2>.<num $n3>イルム）×<num $n4>を入手した。
#. de: Du spießt <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1><else><num $n4> <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></if> mit einer Länge von <num $n2>,<num $n3> Ilmen auf!
#. fr: Vous avez pêché <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 $n4 1></if> de <num $n2>,<num $n3> <if ($n2 <= 1)>ilm<else>ilms</if>.
#. macro: <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 4 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n4> — a number; value = number parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 4, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3577:0:5"
msgid "You spear <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1></if> measuring <num $n2>.<num $n3> ilms!"
msgstr "Вы ловите острогой <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n4 1></if> длиной <num $n2>.<num $n3> ильма!"

#. ja: <switch $n1><case>スモールギグヘッド<case>ミドルギグヘッド<case>ラージギグヘッド</switch>を装着した。
#. de: Du hast eine <switch $n1><case>kleine<case>mittlere<case>große</switch> Spitze an deiner Harpune angebracht.
#. fr: Vous avez fixé une pointe de <switch $n1><case>petite<case>moyenne<case>grande</switch> taille sur votre harpon.
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Small<case>Normal<case>Large</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3578:0:5"
msgid "<switch $n1><case>Small<case>Normal<case>Large</switch> gig head affixed."
msgstr "<switch $n1><case>Маленькая<case>Норма<case>Большая</switch> насадка для остроги установлена."

#. ja: 釣り手帳に新しい漁場「<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>」の情報を記録した！
#. de: Der neue Speerfischgrund „<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>“ wurde in deinem Fischer-Notizbuch vermerkt.
#. fr: Vous notez l'emplacement du point de harponnage “<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>” dans votre carnet.
#. macro: <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = PlaceName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3579:0:5"
msgid "Data on <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> is added to your fishing log."
msgstr "Запись о месте «<noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>» добавлена в рыбацкий журнал."

#. ja: 何も獲れなかった……。<br>銛先が漁場にあってないようだ。
#. de: Du hast nichts erwischt. <br>Vielleicht ist die Harpunenspitze nicht die richtige für diesen Speerfischgrund.
#. fr: Vous n'avez rien attrapé. <br>La pointe de votre harpon ne semble pas convenir aux proies d'ici.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3580:0:5"
msgid "Nothing speared. <br>The gig head you are using may not be suited to this location."
msgstr "Ничего не поймано. <br>Похоже, эта насадка для остроги не подходит для данного места."

#. ja: 何も獲れなかった……。<br>タイミングが悪いようだ。
#. de: Du hast nichts erwischt. <br>Vielleicht hast du nicht den richtigen Moment abgepasst.
#. fr: Vous n'avez rien attrapé. <br>Vous ne semblez pas harponner au bon moment.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3581:0:5"
msgid "Nothing speared. <br>Your timing may be off."
msgstr "Ничего не поймано. <br>Похоже, вы выбрали неподходящий момент."

#. ja: 魚に逃げられてしまった……。
#. de: Der Fisch ist entkommen ...
#. fr: Le poisson s'est enfui...
msgctxt "LogMessage:3582:0:5"
msgid "The fish gets away..."
msgstr "Рыба сорвалась..."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>の「<sheet Action $n1 0>」による「<sheet Status $n2 0>」付与確率=<num $n3>％
#. de: <capitalize><sheet Action $n1 0></capitalize> hat nun eine Erfolgrate von <num $n3> %, um <sheet Status $n2 0> auszulösen.
#. fr: Les chances que l'action <sheet Action $n1 0> octroie l'effet <sheet Status $n2 0> sont désormais de <num $n3>%.
#. macro: <sheet Action $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Action, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet Status $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Status, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3583:0:5"
msgid "Chance of <sheet Action $n1 0> bestowing <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> <sheet Status $n2 0> is now <num $n3>%."
msgstr "Шанс того, что умение «<sheet Action $n1 0>» наложит на <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вас<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> эффект «<sheet Status $n2 0>», теперь составляет <num $n3>%."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は所持品に空き枠がないため、漁が行えません。
#. de: Speerfischen kann nicht durchgeführt werden. Kein Platz im Inventar.
#. fr: Impossible de pêcher au harpon. Votre inventaire est plein.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3584:0:5"
msgid "Unable to spearfish. Insufficient inventory space."
msgstr "Нельзя ловить острогой: в инвентаре нет свободного места."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>を入手したが、これ以上持てないためリリースした。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> keinen Platz im Inventar und <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>musst<else>muss</if> <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> wieder schwimmen lassen.
#. fr: Vous avez attrapé <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1>, mais ne pouvant en avoir davantage, vous l'avez relaché<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3585:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>, and release your catch."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> не можете унести больше <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> и отпускаете улов."

#. ja: 何も獲れなかった……。<br>獲得力が足りなかったようだ。
#. de: Dein Sammelgeschick war zu niedrig, um etwas mit der Harpune zu fangen.
#. fr: Votre collecte n'est pas assez élevée pour pêcher cette prise.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3586:0:5"
msgid "Your gathering rating is insufficient for spearing this catch."
msgstr "Ничего не поймано. <br>Ваших навыков собирательства не хватило, чтобы поймать эту добычу острогой."

#. ja: 漁場の残り回数を1回復した！
#. de: Du hast noch einen weiteren Speerfischversuch!
#. fr: Vous pouvez pêcher au harpon une fois sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>re<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:3587:0:5"
msgid "You have been granted an additional gathering attempt at these teeming waters."
msgstr "Вам предоставлена ещё одна попытка ловли в этих богатых рыбой водах."

#. ja: <sheet GatheringPointName $n1 0>が目の前から消え失せた……。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de GatheringPointName 1 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> ist verschwunden.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr GatheringPointName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> a disparu...
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en GatheringPointName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en GatheringPointName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = GatheringPointName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if "<sheet GatheringPointName $n1 1>">vanish<else>vanishes</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GatheringPointName $n1 1> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GatheringPointName, row = number parameter 1, column = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3588:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en GatheringPointName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> <if \"<sheet GatheringPointName $n1 1>\">vanish<else>vanishes</if> from sight..."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en GatheringPointName 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> <if \"<sheet GatheringPointName $n1 1>\">исчезают<else>исчезает</if> из виду..."

#. ja: 銛先を選んでいないので、魚突きができません。
#. de: Du musst zuerst eine Spitze an deiner Harpune anbringen.
#. fr: Impossible de pêcher au harpon. Vous n'avez pas sélectionné de pointe de harpon.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3589:0:5"
msgid "Unable to spearfish without first selecting a gig head."
msgstr "Нельзя ловить острогой, пока не выбрана насадка."

#. ja: <sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2>
#. de: <capitalize><sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2></capitalize>
#. fr: <sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2>
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SpearfishingEcology, row = number parameter 1, column = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3590:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2></capitalize>"
msgstr "<capitalize><sheet SpearfishingEcology $n1 $n2></capitalize>"

#. ja: 何も獲れなかった……。
#. de: Nichts erwischt.
#. fr: Vous n'avez rien attrapé.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3591:0:5"
msgid "Nothing speared."
msgstr "Ничего не поймано."

#. ja: 魚に逃げられてしまった……。<br>アタリを見逃したようだ。
#. de: Der Fisch ist entkommen ... Du hast deine Chance vertan.
#. fr: Le poisson s'est enfui... Vous avez laissé échapper votre chance.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3592:0:5"
msgid "The fish gets away... You missed your chance!"
msgstr "Рыба сорвалась... Вы упустили свой шанс!"

#. ja: アクション「泳がせ釣りII」のエサとなる魚を釣り上げた。
#. de: Du hast einen Fisch gefangen, der als Naturköder II geeignet ist.
#. fr: Vous avez attrapé un poisson vous donnant l'opportunité d'utiliser Pêche au vif II.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3593:0:5"
msgid "You land a fish usable with Mooch II."
msgstr "Вы поймали рыбу, которую можно использовать как наживку II."

#. ja: 泳がせ釣りのチャンスを失った。
#. de: Die Gelegenheit zum Köderfisch-Angeln ist dir entgangen ...
#. fr: Vous avez laissé échapper votre chance de pêche au vif...
msgctxt "LogMessage:3594:0:5"
msgid "You miss your chance to mooch..."
msgstr "Вы упускаете возможность ловить на живца..."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>の「<sheet Action $n1 0>」による「<sheet Status $n2 0>」効果：+<num $n3>％
#. de: <capitalize><sheet Action $n1 0></capitalize> erhöht die Wirkung von <sheet Status $n2 0> um <num $n3> %.
#. fr: L'action <sheet Action $n1 0> augmente l'effet <sheet Status $n2 0> de <num $n3>%.
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet Action $n1 0></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet Action $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Action, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>your<else><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>'s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet Status $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Status, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3595:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><sheet Action $n1 0></capitalize> increases <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>your<else><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>'s</if> <sheet Status $n2 0> effectiveness by <num $n3>%."
msgstr "<capitalize><sheet Action $n1 0></capitalize> повышает эффективность эффекта «<sheet Status $n2 0>» у <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вас<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> на <num $n3>%."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>を入手しました。「スクリップ取引窓口」にて<sheet Item $n1 0>をアイテムと交換することができるようになります。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> erhalten.<br><capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1></capitalize> können bei Scheinewechslern gegen verschiedene Gegenstände eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Vous avez obtenu <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1>.<br><capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 2 1></capitalize> peuvent être échangé<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s contre des objets auprès des comptables des assignats.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3596:0:5"
msgid "You obtain <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>. <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> can be used to purchase various items at <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>scrip exchanges</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Вы получаете <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>. <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></capitalize> можно обменять на различные предметы в <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>обменниках жетонов</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 今は銛先を変更できません。
#. de: Die Spitze kann jetzt nicht gewechselt werden.
#. fr: Impossible de changer la pointe de votre harpon ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3597:0:5"
msgid "Unable to change gig head at this time."
msgstr "Сейчас нельзя сменить насадку для остроги."

#. ja: <string $gs1>は未知の漁場で漁を開始した。
#. de: Du beginnst an einem unbekannten Speerfischgrund zu fischen.
#. fr: Vous commencez à pêcher à un point de harponnage intact.
msgctxt "LogMessage:3598:0:5"
msgid "You begin spearfishing at unspoiled teeming waters."
msgstr "Вы начинаете ловить острогой в нетронутых богатых рыбой водах."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n2 0>を<kilo $n1 ","><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if>枚手に入れた。
#. de: Du hast <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 4 1><else><kilo $n1 "."> <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1></if> <if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3><nbsp>%) </if>erhalten.
#. fr: Vous monétisez <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"><if ($n3 == 0)><else><nbsp>(+<num $n3>%)</if> <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 2 1>.
