#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)>vous<else><if $gn8><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if (2 == 8)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if $gn6><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs3><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs3></if></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>avez<else>a</if> activé le portail magique<nbsp>!
