msgctxt "LogMessage:3778:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>complete<else>completes</if> preparations to enter the portal."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>вы</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> готов<if ($gs1 == $gs3)>ы<else><if $gn8><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn8 6>\">а<else></if><else><if $gn6>а<else></if></if></if> войти в портал."

#. ja: <if $gn8><sheet ObjStr $gn8 0><else>{$gs3}</if>が、転送魔紋の起動をキャンセルした……
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn8><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>hast<else>hat</if> den Transport über das Äthergramm abgebrochen.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)>vous<else><if $gn8><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if (2 == 8)><if $gn67>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs3><else><if $gn6><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs3><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs3></if></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>avez<else>a</if> désactivé le portail magique.
