#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 8, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>deactivate<else>deactivates</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:3779:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs3)>deactivate<else>deactivates</if> the teleportation portal."
